{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How high can you go? Find out in Go Up, the relaxing and atmospheric idle game that never stops.\u00a0In this demo you will have access to only the first tier of skills available in the full game, but you can still get a taste of the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect dust, spice, and chaos as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/extras/GoldenDust.gif?t=1752705446\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>. Collect enough <strong>Dust</strong> and you\u2019ll earn a <strong>Golden Dust</strong> to spend on upgrading your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Journey through vast and varied environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/extras/Boost.gif?t=1752705446\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through 11 unique and vibrant regions as you traverse the realms, ascending from the pits of \ud83d\udd25<strong>Tartarus</strong>\ud83d\udd25 through \u2740<strong>Elysium</strong>\u2740 and beyond into the heavenly \u2727<strong>Cosmos</strong>\u2727.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>If you\u2019re not going up, you\u2019re going down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press any button to Go Up, but don\u2019t stop pressing, or you will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/extras/skill_tree_1920x1080.png?t=1752705446\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An expansive skill tree offers over 50 unique skills to help you Go Up faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve got \ud83e\uddf2<strong>Magnets</strong>\ud83e\uddf2.<br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\ud83d\ude80Boosters\ud83d\ude80</strong>.<br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\u23ebAccelerators\u23eb</strong> and \ud83d\udeab\u23ec<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>\u23ec\ud83d\udeab.<br>And lots of other upgrades that you can find in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/extras/high_score_1920x1080.jpg?t=1752705446\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player\u2019s high score to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u266b \u266a \u266c<strong> Music to put you in the zone\u00a0</strong>\u266b \u266a \u266c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785400?t=1752705446","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/5090fede6f250159dd929a1a87631e73dd9629cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752705446","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/6572a9390e7a1a70ca6226d3f514349dc51d243d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752705446","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/6572a9390e7a1a70ca6226d3f514349dc51d243d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752705446","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"de