 will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/extras/skill_tree_1920x1080.png?t=1752705446\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An expansive skill tree offers over 50 unique skills to help you Go Up faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve got \ud83e\uddf2<strong>Magnets</strong>\ud83e\uddf2.<br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\ud83d\ude80Boosters\ud83d\ude80</strong>.<br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\u23ebAccelerators\u23eb</strong> and \ud83d\udeab\u23ec<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>\u23ec\ud83d\udeab.<br>And lots of other upgrades that you can find in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/extras/high_score_1920x1080.jpg?t=1752705446\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player\u2019s high score to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u266b \u266a \u266c<strong> Music to put you in the zone\u00a0</strong>\u266b \u266a \u266c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>","developers":["Noble Whale Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2934520","name":"Go Up"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785400/a573a16e4e09c2c9172375f10d72821333d8ba84/header.jpg?t=1752705446","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright Noble Whale Studios 20